{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"email-address-validator UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"email-address-validator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["email-address-validator.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Syntax nag-iisa ay hindi maaaring ipakita kung ang isang domain ay tumatanggap ng mail, isang server ay maaabot o isang mailbox ay umiiral. Ang tagasuri na ito ay hindi magsagawa ng DNS, MX o mailbox checks. Quoted lokal na bahagi at internationalized lokal na bahagi ay hindi suportado; ang address ay pinoproseso sa lokal at hindi naka-imbak o ipinadala.","record_id":"c4249e0608032e5327babcb4e33c1f65d00a0781efe6453638c0fb6f2134b75f","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":5.865064377750059,"source":"Syntax alone cannot show whether a domain accepts mail, a server is reachable or a mailbox exists. This checker does not perform DNS, MX or mailbox checks. Quoted local parts and internationalized local parts are not supported; the address is processed locally and not stored or sent.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"db4bfb2e69de003e37ed9395af6a1ee6e2f63988808c4d04d2f56111f7da2805","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Syntax nag-iisa ay hindi maaaring ipakita kung ang isang domain ay tumatanggap ng mail, isang server ay maaabot o isang mailbox ay umiiral. Ang tagasuri na ito ay hindi magsagawa ng DNS, MX o mailbox checks. Quoted lokal na bahagi at internationalized lokal na bahagi ay hindi suportado; ang address ay pinoproseso sa lokal at hindi naka-imbak o ipinadala.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
